  "code": "def predict(tokens, prompt):\n    # Only the token at index 3 (third input symbol after BOS) matters: E0011.\n    # Head 0.1 moves it to the last position (E0012, E0005); mlp0 maps it to the output symbol (E0010, E0014).\n    # sigma read off the model's input/output pairs (E0001): bo<->lu, fe<->ka, ri fixed.\n    sigma = {1: 5, 5: 1, 3: 4, 4: 3, 6: 6}\n    return sigma[int(tokens[3])]\n",
